# Force the canonical domain: anyone landing on the free Netlify subdomain is
# 301-redirected to the same path on gharkamali.com. Requests already on
# gharkamali.com don't match these host-scoped rules, so there is no loop.
# (Razorpay only allows payments from registered domains — this stops payment
# attempts originating from gkmapp.netlify.app.)
https://gkmapp.netlify.app/* https://gharkamali.com/:splat 301!
http://gkmapp.netlify.app/* https://gharkamali.com/:splat 301!
